		{"id":"tabla-status","type":"text","text":"### Catálogo IdStatus (TimbradoLog)\n\n| Status | Description | StatusKey |\n|---|---|---|\n| Failed | Technical or functional error during generation (Failure) | failed |\n| Pending | Document requested but not processed (Start of flow) | pending |\n| Generated | Document generated successfully (Success) | generated |\n| Processing | Document in generation process (Intermediate state) | processing |","x":280,"y":1780,"width":780,"height":260},
		{"id":"step1","type":"text","text":"**1. Finanzas → BD PQF2**\nGuarda base factura `fccFactura` con campo `FacturaAdelantado = true`","x":0,"y":220,"width":280,"height":130},
